  "paragraphs": [
    [
      "On the first of ",
      { "id": "mayo", "es": "mayo", "en": "May" },
      " we leave the ships. Each ",
      { "id": "hombre", "es": "hombre", "en": "man" },
      " is given two ",
      { "id": "libra", "es": "libras", "en": "pounds" },
      " of ",
      { "id": "bizcocho", "es": "bizcocho", "en": "biscuit" },
      " and half a ",
      { "id": "libra", "es": "libra", "en": "pound" },
      " of bacon. That is the whole of the ",
      { "id": "comida", "es": "comida", "en": "food" },
      ". The ",
      { "id": "gobernador", "es": "gobernador", "en": "governor" },
      " says we will find villages, and villages have ",
      { "id": "comida", "es": "comida", "en": "food" },
      ". I write the ration in my book and put the book inside my shirt."
    ],
    [
      "The ",
      { "id": "tierra", "es": "tierra", "en": "land" },
      " is flat. The ",
      { "id": "tierra", "es": "tierra", "en": "land" },
      " is ",
      { "id": "arena", "es": "arena", "en": "sand" },
      ". We walk ",
      { "id": "norte", "es": "norte", "en": "north" },
      " through ",
      { "id": "arena", "es": "arena", "en": "sand" },
      " and ",
      { "id": "palmito", "es": "palmitos", "en": "palmettos" },
      " and ",
      { "id": "pino", "es": "pinos", "en": "pines" },
      ", and the ",
      { "id": "pino", "es": "pinos", "en": "pines" },
      " are the only shade. Some are split by lightning. Some have fallen. All of them look the same. For fifteen days there is no village, no field, no person."
    ],
    [
      "The ",
      { "id": "bizcocho", "es": "bizcocho", "en": "biscuit" },
      " does not last. Then it is ",
      { "id": "palmito", "es": "palmitos", "en": "palmettos" },
      ": we cut the young hearts out of them and eat them raw, and they are not ",
      { "id": "comida", "es": "comida", "en": "food" },
      ", they are something to chew so that the mouth remembers. ",
      { "id": "hambre", "es": "Hambre", "en": "Hunger" },
      " is a plain word. In Spanish it is the same word for a hungry ",
      { "id": "hombre", "es": "hombre", "en": "man" },
      " and for a famine, and by the middle of ",
      { "id": "mayo", "es": "mayo", "en": "May" },
      " I understand why."
    ],
    [
      "The ",
      { "id": "gobernador", "es": "gobernador", "en": "governor" },
      " rides at the front and does not look back. I walk with the ",
      { "id": "hombre", "es": "hombres", "en": "men" },
      ". I count: three hundred ",
      { "id": "hombre", "es": "hombres", "en": "men" },
      ", fifteen days, no villages. ",
      { "id": "fortuna", "es": "Fortuna", "en": "Fortune" },
      " has left us the ",
      { "id": "sol", "es": "sol", "en": "sun" },
      ", which we do not want, and the ",
      { "id": "arena", "es": "arena", "en": "sand" },
      ", which goes on. At night the ",
      { "id": "pino", "es": "pinos", "en": "pines" },
      " make a sound like the ",
      { "id": "mar", "es": "mar", "en": "sea" },
      ". Some of the ",
      { "id": "hombre", "es": "hombres", "en": "men" },
      " who were at Trinidad in the ",
      { "id": "tormenta", "es": "tormenta", "en": "storm" },
      " wake when they hear it."
    ],
    [
      "On the fifteenth day a ",
      { "id": "hombre", "es": "hombre", "en": "man" },
      " at the front shouts. Not a village. Water, moving. A ",
      { "id": "rio", "es": "río", "en": "river" },
      ". The ",
      { "id": "hambre", "es": "hambre", "en": "hunger" },
      " does not go away, but for the first time in fifteen days it has to share us with something else."
    ]
  ],
